---
// The IFS map: Self at the centre, protectors around it, exiles held underneath.
---
<svg class="dgm" viewBox="0 0 640 520" role="img" aria-labelledby="sm-t sm-d">
  <title id="sm-t">The IFS map of the mind</title>
  <desc id="sm-d">Self sits at the centre. Around it are protector parts: managers, who act in advance to keep things under control, and firefighters, who react fast when pain breaks through. Underneath, the protectors guard exiles: younger parts carrying old hurt, fear or shame.</desc>
  <circle cx="320" cy="250" r="230" class="dgm-ring1" />
  <circle cx="320" cy="250" r="150" class="dgm-ring2" />
  <circle cx="320" cy="250" r="70" class="dgm-core" />
  <text x="320" y="246" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-core-t">Self</text>
  <text x="320" y="270" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-core-s">calm · clear · curious</text>
  <text x="320" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-h">Managers</text>
  <text x="320" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-s">plan, control, please, criticise</text>
  <text x="128" y="250" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-h">Firefighters</text>
  <text x="128" y="270" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-s">numb, distract,</text>
  <text x="128" y="288" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-s">explode</text>
  <text x="512" y="250" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-h">Managers</text>
  <text x="512" y="270" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-s">over-prepare,</text>
  <text x="512" y="288" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-s">push, explain</text>
  <text x="320" y="370" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-h dgm-ex">Exiles</text>
  <text x="320" y="390" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-s">old hurt, fear, shame</text>
  <text x="320" y="510" text-anchor="middle" class="dgm-note">PROTECTORS GUARD THE EXILES · SELF CAN LEAD THEM ALL</text>
</svg>
<style>
  .dgm { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0 auto; }
  .dgm text { font-family: var(--sans); }
  .dgm-ring1 { fill: var(--stone); stroke: var(--stone-rule); }
  .dgm-ring2 { fill: #DCD5C8; stroke: var(--stone-rule); }
  .dgm-core { fill: var(--night); }
  .dgm-core-t { font-family: var(--serif) !important; font-size: 34px; fill: var(--brass-light); }
  .dgm-core-s { font-size: 12px; fill: #D8D5CF; }
  .dgm-h { font-family: var(--serif) !important; font-size: 24px; fill: var(--ink); }
  .dgm-ex { font-style: italic; fill: var(--brass); }
  .dgm-s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--muted-2); }
  .dgm-note { font-family: var(--mono) !important; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .06em; fill: var(--brass); }
</style>
